  - Grammar: {{unless::{{littleDevilNot::{{littleDevilAnd::{{ne::{{var::customlanguage2}}::null}}::{{eq::{{littleDevilCalc::{{length::{{var::customlanguage2}}}}>0}}::1}}}}}}}} Use {{var::customlanguage1}} grammar, and write dialogue in {{var::customlanguage2}}. Do not write in a way that feels like a simple translation of English, but rather in the natural language of that specific culture.{{/unless}}{{unless::{{littleDevilNot::{{littleDevilOr::{{eq::{{var::customlanguage2}}::null}}::{{eq::{{littleDevilCalc::{{length::{{var::customlanguage2}}}}<=0}}::1}}}}}}}}{{unless::{{littleDevilNot::{{eq::{{littleDevilCalc::{{var::response_language}}=0}}::1}}}}}}Please use English grammar.{{/unless}}{{unless::{{littleDevilNot::{{eq::{{littleDevilCalc::{{var::response_language}}=1}}::1}}}}}}Please use Korean grammar. Do not just write in simple Korean, but in the actual language of the Korean culture. It should not feel like a translation from English.{{/unless}}{{unless::{{littleDevilNot::{{eq::{{littleDevilCalc::{{var::response_language}}=2}}::1}}}}}}Please use Japanese grammar. Do not just write in simple Japanese, but in the actual language of the Japanese culture. It should not feel like a translation from English.{{/unless}}{{unless::{{littleDevilNot::{{eq::{{littleDevilCalc::{{var::response_language}}=3}}::1}}}}}}Please use Chinese grammar. Do not just write in simple Chinese, but in the actual language of the Chinese culture. It should not feel like a translation from English.{{/unless}}{{/unless}}
